# libpdx-font deps.list
#
# Wave:  R102, Wave CC
# Doc:   design/graphics/r102-user-plan.md §2.1 in paideia-os.
#
# libpdx-font 0.6.0 has NO library dependencies. It is pure userspace:
# FontApi/Font8x16/FontLayout read only caller-supplied buffers and
# this library's own embedded .rodata glyph table; FontMetrics issues
# one raw sys_write of its own (fd 2) rather than routing through
# libpdx-semantic-pipe or libpdx-audit; FontSchema::font_schema_init
# (M3-001, #6) is a WEAK stub returning a deterministic handle rather
# than a real schema-registry round-trip — there is no linkable
# `libpdx-schema-registry` (or equivalent) client to call yet. Wiring
# either real dependency (schema registry for FontSchema, semantic-pipe
# for a future real FontMetrics emit path) is M3 follow-up work (see
# caps.decl's declares_output_schemas note and src/font_schema.pdx's
# own header for the full writeup).
#
# Format (mirrors design/tooling/plan.md §6.4 `deps.list` shape):
#   <name>  <semver-lo>..<semver-hi>  <link-kind>
# link-kind is one of: static, dynamic, shape.
#
# (No library entries.)

# Toolchain floor (informational; enforced by pkg-install, not link):
toolchain:paideia-as   >= 0.21.0   build
